  "guid": "com.jbobyh.itempreviewqol",
  "name": "Item Preview QoL + screenshots",
  "slug": "item-preview-qol-screenshots",
  "teaser": "Better item preview: zoom, pan, rotate lights, fullscreen, and alpha screenshots. UI Fixes compatible.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2909.jpg",
  "downloads": 14399,
  "favourites_count": 41,
  "description": "<h2><strong>Demonstration</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"I4yoibWsUOU\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/I4yoibWsUOU?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/I4yoibWsUOU/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<h3><strong>Features</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Toggleable screenshot button in the inspect panel. Captures a screenshot of the item with transparent background (Documents\\Escape from Tarkov\\Screenshots). Thanks to Tarkin for his TarkinItemExporter example.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>-&gt;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fullscreen preview mode</li>\n<li>Closer-than-vanilla zoom</li>\n<li>Any angle item rotation</li>\n<li>Move the item freely within the window</li>\n<li>Lighting rotation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>Controls</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Double-click</strong> anywhere in the window — toggle fullscreen</li>\n<li><strong>Left mouse drag</strong> — rotate the item</li>\n<li><strong>Right mouse drag</strong> — rotate lights around the item</li>\n<li><strong>Mouse scroll wheel</strong> — zoom in/out</li>\n<li><strong>Middle mouse drag</strong> — move the item</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Installation</strong></h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Unzip the downloaded file.</li>\n<li>Drag and drop the BepInEx folder into your root directory.</li>\n</ol>\n",
